{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13198","headline":"庐山歌送至弘法师兼呈薛江州 · 皇甫冉","name":"庐山歌送至弘法师兼呈薛江州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"释子去兮访名山，禅舟容与兮住仍前。\n猿啾啾兮怨月，江渺渺兮多烟。\n东林西林兮入何处，上方下方兮通石路。\n连湘接楚饶桂花，事久年深无杏树。\n使君爱人兼爱山，时引双旌万木间。\n政成人野皆不扰，遂令法侣性安闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13198.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13198","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}